== Real-World Datasets (used, not redistributed) ==

The TSFMI evaluation pipeline uses several existing public datasets under
their original licenses:

- ETTh1 / ETTh2: see https://github.com/zhouhaoyi/ETDataset (CC-BY 4.0)
- Jena Climate (Weather): Max Planck Institute for Biogeochemistry (CC-BY 4.0)
- Electricity (LD2011_2014): UCI ML Repository (CC-BY 4.0)
- Traffic: California Department of Transportation (PEMS), public domain
- Exchange Rate: per original distributors (research use)
- UCR Time Series Archive: see https://www.cs.ucr.edu/~eamonn/time_series_data_2018/

Users must comply with the original license of each dataset. TSFMI does not
redistribute these datasets; the codebase only contains loaders that consume
the user's own copy of each dataset.
